    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11f6a45a66ca5f8aa5b58d5f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆至今努力不懈地累积“成果”。\n因此观众现在很期待她在大舞台上的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69f5684add7cad8b4317d6582741545856dd1756bcb3ea40de8b5ab29d1a132c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
