    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a97025f7b4c275f0fb4902a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其他参赛者中有跳舞城与荒漠英雄等，\n可说是强敌环伺。\n她们也都下战帖，宣告自己将会获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12d90dd37c7a3e7f71a65a20e70ab18d63d8d2e37b5dc7097ade5d17740700a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
