    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2f003dca223a5ac3ae91945",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆为她们的热情感到开心。\n为了在“有马纪念”获胜，\n以不变的“考验”身份称霸下去，她前往决战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f17a2fbd9c180fb9dbccad56b5631e91cf18339f5c1d7ad23f616ad53507a0f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
