      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆在出道战拿下好成绩。\n在这场比赛中，她顺利地按计划跑完全程，\n身体没有发生异常。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08319e218a597a030ae2a53fc8160443ceaf3c439c4cb8a0bc5b061bbc41d49e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
