    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6569409217cf8357c0c71cfa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个发言在隔天被夸大报导，\n甚至引发一些人的反弹，认为她多管闲事。\n但她毫不动摇，只想着要如何达成“使命”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5eb8f46b82701dad69022de35418721d9e0118554e378d778ecb38593994de1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
