      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后，\n将她视为竞争对手的谷野美酒前来向她宣战，\n还表示期待有一天在比赛中分出高下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c044b1dad97b3d64b947776a74e567f74c33fa2f2f3964dcf70b64fc1f973bbc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
