    {
      "uid": "zhcn:495e65f23a9552d2469ccfe8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆结束武者修行。\n为了“革命”，她表示接下来要在决定本世代\n日本第一的“日本德比”中展现自己的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbb55652d2ad25251fb43bfbbeb188cfecaf6e010019a72400d033438b96d59d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
