      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她想参赛距离相同的“青叶赏”作为前哨战。\n她决心要与训练员一起完成该完成的事情，\n并且必定获得胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b2fcff445f263fd0d86248a11802626fbe2d394854b6a328a2f0c5d7ad010f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
