      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员听到这件事，\n推测谷野美酒或许是想证明，\n自己的资质跑英里跟中距离都不成问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98a4ad5c9a9ca26483d4e34e2d77337580fb71307da7868079510db828787ceb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
