    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbda5f996502aa95c604736a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆同意了这个说法。\n但无论对手是谁，她的使命都不会改变。\n下个目标是“青叶赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5de1ecfe4e322a73db76821a2eea29c9bc5a185aac23a13e83b9777cb93af67a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
