    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1353bbe76b94afa3c091106b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆展现了“成果”。\n但因为感觉到在“日本德比”之前，\n尚有许多必须改善的地方，而持续绷紧神经。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5247572657fe6fd9aba80332ebd214ffedd9aea931af0568c6a82177ef357e5f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
