    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33c385952c57fe890892d28d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "观众们肯定了她的强悍实力，\n但似乎也有少部分人对她冷淡的态度感到不悦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "584ff88cb31cbd4030612cc5ebc96538ba2bc432f0ca15d927d34d8cee663ba3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
