    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8b54430d9145644885308ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，吉兆仍保持专注，\n朝着使命勇往直前。\n距离决战“日本德比”时日无多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ac212281be4e84e9259749d4865f3c28a4eb8ab1af05d96cb8db78fcd838c54",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083419.json",
