      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆在日本德比中获胜，\n精彩地破除了“青叶赏”的魔咒。\n但她不打算止步于此，已放眼专注在下一场比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "511484067d04db48f7e1eee5997f9de078f0385c4a0103c9891b37f659c0095c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
