      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后，谷野美酒宣告谢幕并离去，\n吉兆推测不出她的真意为何。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f75dc79ce9da037199d35af2ab5eceff8668472acf1586234d7bff3d4e93d2e6",
